# Redesign Buyer Marketplace UI

The goal is to completely revamp the Buyer Marketplace to feel premium, dynamic, and state-of-the-art. We will move away from flat greens and basic layouts to a rich aesthetic featuring modern typography, glassmorphism, micro-animations, and a highly engaging hero section.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please review this UI redesign plan. This will change the visual look of your Marketplace page significantly to make it feel much more premium and modern.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Hero Section & Layout
- Replace the basic gradient hero with a dynamic, immersive banner featuring a high-quality abstract agricultural background (or CSS animated gradient) with a glassmorphic overlay.
- Redesign the `SearchBar` to float seamlessly within the hero section, featuring a glowing focus state and smooth expand animations.
- Ensure the overall page spacing (`pt-28`, `gap-12`) is tightened and refined to feel like a cohesive, single-page application rather than disjointed sections.

### 2. ProductCard Component
- Increase image prominence and roundness.
- Add a subtle inner shadow and floating effect on hover using `framer-motion` spring animations.
- Replace the hard borders with soft shadows and a very subtle `border-gray-50`.
- Update the "View Details" button to a sleek, modern pill shape with a gradient hover effect.

### 3. CategoryCard & FilterPanel
- Redesign the Categories to use soft, pastel gradients rather than flat colors, with bouncing micro-animations on hover.
- Modernize the `FilterPanel` sidebar to use custom-styled checkboxes, sleek sliders for price range, and a cleaner hierarchical layout.

### 4. Typography and Colors
- Emphasize modern typography by adjusting font weights (extra bold for headings, medium for metadata) and tracking.
- Shift the primary green to a richer emerald/teal palette, accented with warm yellows for ratings and organic badges.

